  "changelog": "Initial release of the 1688-distribution skill \u2014 unified entry for all 1688 distribution business workflows.\n\n- Provides a single command-line interface for product selection/distribution, order management, knowledge-base query, and shop binding.\n- Strict output, error-handling, and compliance rules: no fabricated data, no unauthorized brand distribution, no extra suggestions or guidance in user responses.\n- Requires reference.md to be read before any business CLI is executed, ensuring command schema accuracy.\n- Automatic, silent handling of Access Key (AK) authorization; never exposes AK details or links to users.\n- Covers full flow for product selection, shop confirmation, distribution, order queries, risk handling, and knowledge search, with explicit markdown output formats.\n- Includes comprehensive, codified business restrictions and exception handling to ensure compliance with 1688 distribution requirements.",
